# Rear wisp brush blend v04

Built-in ImageGen source revision blends the original long flowing veil with
broader soft cloudy brush strokes. The initial dense smoky cloud version was
rejected and was not imported. Prompt direction: roughly 70% original flowing
wisps / 30% broad patches; quiet brush-like interiors, soft ends, open black
gaps, no dense mounds, hairline tangles, granular noise, sky color or text.

Selected source: `Source_WispCloud.png`. The 4096x2048 delivery is resampled from
the generated source; RGB neutral illumination, A smooth coverage. Existing
high-altitude attenuation is retained. U wraps, V clamps; first and last columns
match exactly. Zenith/horizon fades prevent a pole seam or hard edge.

Assigned only as the current level actor's Skybox Base Texture:
`/Game/RXSkySystem/Cubeless/PaintedCloud/v03/Evolution/SkyboxBlend/AtmosphereWispBrush_v04/T_AtmosphereWispBrush_v04`.
Front clouds, existing flowmap, time, material/BP code and scalar settings are
unchanged. Old source textures remain available. Exported/imported RGBA pixels
match the delivery image. Current viewport result was inspected.

Evidence and pre-change map backup:
`MCPGameProject/Saved/PaintedEvolutionV03/RearWispCloud/`.
